              <span class="bento-domain">OBSERVATIONAL ASTROPHYSICS</span>
            </div>
            <span class="bento-period mono text-tertiary">ICSP KOLKATA · 2026</span>
          </div>

          <h3 class="bento-card-title">
            <a href="/projects/ic-1369-photometry-pipeline" class="title-link no-underline">
              Variable Star Photometry &amp; Isochronal Age of IC 1369
            </a>
          </h3>

          <p class="bento-card-desc text-secondary">
            Reduction of 814 time-series CCD frames using DAOPHOT point-spread-function extraction, 
            Lomb-Scargle periodograms, and PARSEC isochrone CMD fitting for open cluster IC 1369.
          </p>

          <div class="bento-math-box">
            <div set:html={eqMonoAstro} />
          </div>

          <div class="bento-metrics-strip mono" style="margin-bottom: 14px; display: flex; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap;">
            <span class="mono text-gold" style="font-size: 0.75rem; background: var(--bg-surface-elevated); padding: 3px 8px; border-radius: 4px; border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);">PERIOD P = 1.4820 d</span>
            <span class="mono text-accent" style="font-size: 0.75rem; background: var(--bg-surface-elevated); padding: 3px 8px; border-radius: 4px; border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);">PRECISION σ ≤ 0.014 mag</span>
          </div>

          <div class="bento-card-footer hairline-top">
            <span class="bento-tools mono text-tertiary">PYTHON · ASTROPY · DAOPHOT · PARSEC</span>
            <a href="/projects/ic-1369-photometry-pipeline" class="editorial-btn">
              View Project <span class="btn-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- Card 2: ASTRA Rust Toolkit -->
        <article class="bento-card hairline-box spotlight-card interactive-row corner-crosshair">
          <div class="bento-card-header">
            <div class="bento-tags mono">
              <span class="bento-num text-signal">02</span>
              <span class="bento-domain">ASTRODYNAMICS &amp; SIMULATION</span>
            </div>
            <span class="bento-period mono text-tertiary">RUST ENGINE · 2026</span>
          </div>

          <h3 class="bento-card-title">
            <a href="/projects/astra-rust-toolkit" class="title-link no-underline">
              ASTRA: High-Performance Rust Astrodynamics Toolkit
            </a>
          </h3>

          <p class="bento-card-desc text-secondary">
            Deterministic N-body orbital propagation using Yoshida symplectic integrators preserving Hamiltonian energy to ΔE/E₀ &lt; 10⁻¹² over 10⁶ steps, J₂ oblateness perturbations, and SGP4 propagation.
          </p>

          <div class="bento-math-box">
            <div set:html={eqMonoASTRA} />
          </div>

          <div class="bento-metrics-strip mono" style="margin-bottom: 14px; display: flex; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap;">
            <span class="mono text-gold" style="font-size: 0.75rem; background: var(--bg-surface-elevated); padding: 3px 8px; border-radius: 4px; border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);">ENERGY DRIFT &lt; 10⁻¹²</span>
            <span class="mono text-accent" style="font-size: 0.75rem; background: var(--bg-surface-elevated); padding: 3px 8px; border-radius: 4px; border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);">INTEGRATOR: YOSHIDA / DOP853</span>
          </div>

          <div class="bento-card-footer hairline-top">
            <span class="bento-tools mono text-tertiary">RUST · SIMD · SYMPLECTIC YOSHIDA · SGP4</span>
            <a href="/projects/astra-rust-toolkit" class="editorial-btn">
              View Project <span class="btn-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- Card 3: Radon CT Tumour Detection -->
        <article class="bento-card hairline-box spotlight-card interactive-row corner-crosshair">
          <div class="bento-card-header">
            <div class="bento-tags mono">
              <span class="bento-num text-signal">03</span>
              <span class="bento-domain">COMPUTATIONAL TOMOGRAPHY</span>
            </div>
            <span class="bento-period mono text-tertiary">ALGEBRAIC INVERSION · 2025</span>
          </div>

          <h3 class="bento-card-title">
            <a href="/projects/ct-imaging-tumour-detection" class="title-link no-underline">
              Radon CT Sinogram &amp; Algebraic Tumour Reconstruction
            </a>
          </h3>

          <p class="bento-card-desc text-secondary">
            Continuous Radon projection transforms, Filtered Back-Projection (FBP) with Ram-Lak ramp frequency filtering, 
            and Hounsfield Unit neoplasm segmentation on synthetic Shepp-Logan phantoms.
          </p>

          <div class="bento-math-box">
            <div set:html={eqMonoRadon} />
          </div>

          <div class="bento-card-footer hairline-top">
            <span class="bento-tools mono text-tertiary">NUMPY · SCIPY · SKIMAGE · RADON FBP</span>
            <a href="/projects/ct-imaging-tumour-detection" class="editorial-btn">
              View Project <span class="btn-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- Card 4: Zernike Wavefront Analyzer -->
        <article class="bento-card hairline-box spotlight-card interactive-row corner-crosshair">
          <div class="bento-card-header">
            <div class="bento-tags mono">
              <span class="bento-num text-signal">04</span>
              <span class="bento-domain">ADAPTIVE OPTICS</span>
            </div>
            <span class="bento-period mono text-tertiary">WAVEFRONT MODES · 2025</span>
          </div>

          <h3 class="bento-card-title">
            <a href="/projects/zernike-wavefront-analyzer" class="title-link no-underline">
              Zernike Polynomial Wavefront Decomposition &amp; Modal Analysis
            </a>
